# Datasets and caches: audio is never committed. Episodes are reconstructed
# from ml/configs/sources.yaml by the import/fetch steps (see docs/dataset-card.md).
# Anchored to the repository root -- an unanchored `data/` would also swallow the
# ml/src/slotify_rank/data/ source package.
/data/
# Phase 4 synthetic training fixtures. Generated on demand by
# `slotify-rank training synthesize`; regenerable from a seed, so never
# committed. Kept inside the checkout because manifest paths are, by design,
# repository-relative (see ml/src/slotify_rank/data/paths.py).
/data-synthetic/
*.parquet
*.npy

# Experiment artifacts. Generated reports ARE committed -- they are the
# evidence trail for the evaluation matrix -- so only the bulky binaries are
# ignored.
artifacts/**
!artifacts/
!artifacts/**/
!artifacts/**/*.md
!artifacts/**/*.json
!artifacts/**/*.csv

# One exception: the bootstrap ranker checkpoint (~5.7 MB) is committed so the
# learned inference path works from a fresh clone with no training run. It is a
# WEAKLY SUPERVISED distillation of heuristic_offline_v1 and is not evidence of
# ranking quality -- see artifacts/training/README.md and its own
# training_summary.json, which records label_source: weak_heuristic.
!artifacts/training/gated-d8ed976101aa4c3b/best_checkpoint.pt

